"成绩没能记录下来。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:491
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_SalonMaidenOnHerWay"
msgid ""
"Excuse me, but…\p"
"Our leader, the SALON MAIDEN, is on\n"
"her way here in hopes of battling you.\p"
"She should be arriving very shortly.$"
msgstr ""
"打扰一下……\p"
"我们的首领沙龙少女\n"
"希望和你对战，正往这里赶来。\p"
"她应该马上就到了。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:497
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_ReadyForSalonMaiden"
msgid ""
"You will be facing the SALON MAIDEN.\n"
"Are you prepared?$"
msgstr ""
"你的对手是沙龙少女。\n"
"你准备好了吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_GreetingsImAnabel"
msgid ""
"Greetings…\n"
"My name is ANABEL.\p"
"I am the SALON MAIDEN, and I am in\n"
"charge of running the BATTLE TOWER…\p"
"I have heard several rumors\n"
"about you…\p"
"In all honesty, what I have heard does\n"
"not seem attractive in any way…\p"
"The reason I've come to see you…\n"
"Well, there is but one reason…$"
msgstr ""
"你好……\n"
"我叫莉拉。\p"
"我是沙龙少女，\n"
"负责管理对战塔……\p"
"我听说过一些\n"
"关于你的传闻……\p"
"老实说，我听到的那些\n"
"并没有什么吸引我的地方……\p"
"我来见你的理由……\n"
"嗯，只有一个……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:513
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_LetMeSeeYourTalent"
msgid ""
"Let me see your talent in\n"
"its entirety…$"
msgstr ""
"让我看看\n"
"你全部的才能吧……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:517
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelTalentShallBeRecognized"
msgid ""
"ANABEL: Fufufu, nicely done…\p"
"Your FRONTIER PASS, please…\n"
"Your talent shall be recognized.$"
msgstr ""
"莉拉：呵呵呵，干得不错……\p"
"请给我你的开拓通行证……\n"
"你的才能将得到认可。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:522
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedAbilitySymbol"
msgid ""
"The Ability Symbol was embossed on\n"
"the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"开拓通行证上\n"
"印上了能力标志！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:526
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_UntilNextTime"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"You have confidence in your POKéMON\n"
"battling talent, don't you?\p"
"I urge you to keep battling and\n"
"keep on winning.\p"
"I will be waiting for you.\n"
"Until the next time we meet…$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"你对自己宝可梦的对战才能\n"
"很有自信吧？\p"
"希望你继续战斗，\n"
"继续赢下去。\p"
"我会等着你的。\n"
"直到我们下次相见……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:535
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelYouCameBack"
msgid ""
"ANABEL: You really did come back to\n"
"see me…\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"You've won straight matches to see me…\n"
"I won't have to hold back against you…\p"
"It's been too long now…\p"
"Too long since I've been able to battle\n"
"without thinking about anything…$"
msgstr ""
"莉拉：你真的回来见我了……\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"你一路连胜来见我……\n"
"我不用对你手下留情了……\p"
"已经很久了……\p"
"已经很久没能什么都不想，\n"
"尽情地对战了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:545
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_LetsBeginShallWe"
msgid "Let's begin, shall we?$"
msgstr "我们开始吧？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:548
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AnabelCongratsYourPassPlease"
msgid ""
"ANABEL: Fufu, congratulations…\n"
"Your FRONTIER PASS, please…$"
msgstr ""
"莉拉：呵呵，恭喜你……\n"
"请给我你的开拓通行证……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:552
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_AbilitySymbolTookGoldenShine"
msgid ""
"The Ability Symbol took on\n"
"a golden shine!$"
msgstr ""
"能力标志\n"
"发出了金色的光芒！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom/scripts.inc:556
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleTowerBattleRoom_Text_WishICouldBattleYouAgain"
msgid ""
"That was fun…\p"
"I have never had a POKéMON battle\n"
"so enjoyable before…\p"
"I wish I could battle with you again…$"
msgstr ""
"真开心……\p"
"我从来没有享受过\n"
"这么愉快的宝可梦对战……\p"
"真希望能再和你对战……$"
